// Leave fakkhouse for training the way its trainer cinematic does, with the spawn point
// after a '$'. The level must change, and Julie must start at spawn_fakkhouse. The probe
// ends with the level; read the log ("Server: training$spawn_fakkhouse", no "Can't find
// map"), or put a whatis thread in a sandbox copy of training.scr to read her position.
probe:
waitforplayer
wait 2
map training$spawn_fakkhouse
end
